{"id": "unknown-2026-05-20-017", "date": "2026-05-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 21, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "SAIC Audi sets May 29 launch for AUDI E7X SUV, dropping premium pricing", "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cnevpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2026052010012985.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" /></p>\n<p>The model began pre-sales on May 8, with a starting price of 289,800 yuan, significantly lower than the AUDI team's initial plan.</p>\n<p>For details, please visit <a href=\"https://cnevpost.com\">CnEVPost</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "cnevpost", "url": "https://cnevpost.com/2026/05/20/saic-audi-sets-may-29-launch-for-audi-e7x/", "type": "rss"}]}
